  `- Shockbyte hosting (Claims+Towny): **~$135/mo** provisional (from your invoice paste window ~$185.65 Jun6–Jul17, monthlyized until you label main vs addon)`,
  `- Domains: **$0** placeholder — needs your real annual`,
  `- Cloudflare / Workers / Pages: **$0** placeholder`,
  `- Other non-Stripe income: **$0/mo**`,
  sum?.expensesMonthlyUsd != null
    ? `- Ops burn summed on ledger: **~$${Number(sum.expensesMonthlyUsd).toFixed(2)}/mo**`
    : null,
  "",
  "**My Ava accounts** (project `ava` — allocation / wishlist / buffer / debts)",
  `- Default cash: **$${Number(ava?.accounts?.find((a) => a.id === "acct-default")?.balanceUsd || 0).toFixed(2)}**`,
