  "domains + CF still blank · power/home-lab not on the ledger yet · Ava income rows empty until we route a real slice · customer-level Stripe detail stays in your DM/Telegram only.",
  "",
  "want me to add power / OptiPlex, stamp domains, or route an Ava slice from the next Pro batch — say the numbers and I'll write the ledger.",
].filter((x) => x != null).join("\n");

const msg = await postAvaDiscord({
